              "text": "Siebenschram is a fast German last-trick game from the Eifel region where the winner of the last trick wins the hand."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Siebenschram is documented as a distinct traditional card game with its own player count, equipment, and objective."
